{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117140614338-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117141918\"/><p>單位冒出火舌及滾滾濃煙。</p><p>藍田發生火警。今午(17日)1時43分，啟田邨啟旺樓一單位發生火警，火舌及濃煙竄出窗外，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場開喉灌救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援。消防迅速將火勢救熄，正調查起火原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.959512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:06:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:56.648095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:56.648095+00:00","content_hash":"19f4acd177a5815a3516607e65e666a90f6028a9bc75f4b3099a60f4252b7ec1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}